## Slide 4

Environment

Central environment for template creation and maintenance

Contains and uses generic configurations, not site-specific ones.

Includes subset of systems/products for testing

Defines what is / isn’t part of the template

Ensure template and non-template components can work together.

Supports simulation tags and scripts for validation

