Site N

The Site’s Configuration is added/adjusted in the Pre-Production environment.  This is achieved via the standard TrakSYS Configuration user interfaces.
3

Template Content and Configuration are transferred for testing and verification.  Any adjustments must be re-applied to the Central Development environment.
1

Template Content and Configuration are transferred to the Site’s Pre-Production environment for merging with the Site’s Configuration.
2

The combined Template and Site Content / Configuration are transferred for testing and verification.  Any adjustments must be re-applied to the Pre-Production environment.
4

The verified Site and Template  Content / Configuration is transferred to the Production environment. This transfer is achieved using the standard TrakSYS Database Transfer utility.
