## Slide 12

Site-Specific Customizations & Overrides

Template Transfer Tooling

Governance note: 
Document all local overrides to maintain traceability.

Template Bypass
Use Template Bypass to prevent a page from being overwritten on import.

Combine
Combine shared template content with site-specific configuration.

Add Local Pages
Add local pages under a template tree (ignored by importer).

